        "value": "• 2 x Antenna Ports\nI/O           • 1 x HDMI Port\n• 1 x DisplayPort 1.4\n• 1 x Optical SPDIF Out Port\n• 1 x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C Port (10 Gb/s)\n• 1 x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-A Port (10 Gb/s)\n• 4 x USB 3.2 Gen1 Type-A Ports*\n• 8 x USB 2.0 Ports\n• 1 x RJ-45 LAN Port\n• 1 x BIOS Flashback Button\n• 1 x Line Out Jack (Gold Audio Jack)\n• 1 x Microphone Input Jack (Gold Audio Jack)\n* USB32_12 are Lightning Gaming Ports. USB32_34 support\nUltra USB Power.",
