            "value": "•   PCIE x1 Gigabit LAN 10/100/1000 Mb/s\n•   Realtek RTL8111H\n•   Supports Wake-On-LAN\n•   Supports Lightning/ESD Protection\n•   Supports Energy Efficient Ethernet 802.3az\n•   Supports PXE"
