        "value": "•   2 x Antenna Ports (B650 Pro RS WiFi)\nI/O          •   2 x Antenna Mounting Points (B650 Pro RS)\n•   1 x HDMI Port\n•   1 x DisplayPort 1.4\n•   1 x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-A Port (10 Gb/s) (ReDriver)\n•   1 x USB 3.2 Gen2 Type-C Port (10 Gb/s) (ReDriver)\n•   2 x USB 3.2 Gen1 Ports\n•   6 x USB 2.0 Ports\n•   1 x RJ-45 LAN Port\n•   1 x BIOS Flashback Button\n•   HD Audio Jacks: Line in / Front Speaker / Microphone",
