            "label": "BIOS",
            "value": "•   AMI UEFI Legal BIOS with multilingual GUI support\nFeature                 •   Supports “Plug and Play”\n•   ACPI 5.1 compliance wake up events\n•   Supports jumperfree\n•   SMBIOS 2.3 support\n•   DRAM Voltage multi-adjustment"
